  "description": "The first thing popular swimming star Claude says when he finally meets his idol, Olympic archery champion Nari, is \"Will you marry me?\" Ever since watching her compete on TV four years ago, Claude has been her biggest fan. He even earned a spot on the national swimming team just to get the chance to meet her someday. But his dramatic proposal quickly becomes the talk of the training center. As the awkward incident brings them closer, Claude’s admiration begins to grow into something much deeper.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Kingdom Company's Sarangi Kkotpineun Seonsuchon (사랑이 꽃피는 선수촌) Collection.*",
